  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n60% of 40% of 32% of an amount is Rs. 432.\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nLet the amount be 'x'\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n60% of 40% of 32% of x = Rs. 432\n\n⇒ [((60)/(100)) × ((40)/(100)) × ((32)/(100))]x = 432\n\n⇒ [0.60 × 0.40 × 0.32] × x = 432\n\n⇒ 0.0768 × x = 432\n\n⇒ x = (432)/(0.0768) = Rs. 5625\n\n**∴ The amount is Rs. 5625.**",
